      "params_digest": "e91233f7fac4821b",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predicted Reasoning: *TitleMax of Virginia, Inc., et al. v. Spicher* (No. 25-1359)\\n\\n## Procedural Trajectory (Distributions, Relists, and CVSG)\\n\\nThe docket snapshot (`2026-07-29.json`) currently records a single distribution (`distribution_count: 1`), entered on July 15, 2026 for the September 28, 2026 Long Conference after Respondent waived a response on July 8, 2026, followed by the Court's July 29, 2026 call for a response (due August 28, 2026). Because the July 15 distribu",
