    {
      "call_source": "transcript_item",
      "params_digest": "5c74fac5907e1355",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Predictor Rationale: *TitleMax of Virginia, Inc., et al. v. Spicher* (No. 25-1359)\\n\\n## Headline Call\\n\\n- **Predicted Disposition:** `denied` (`granted: 0`)\\n- **Probability of Grant (`probability` / `disposition`):** `0.04` (4.0%)\\n- **Confidence:** `0.85`\\n- **Big Case Score:** `0.22`\\n\\n## Base-Rate Anchoring (`metrics/statpack.md`)\\n\\nIn `record/context.json`, this cell is in `forward` mode for `term: 2025` with `band: \\\"baseline\\\"` (`salience_version: \\\"sal-v4\\\"`), `distrib",
      "result_capture": "outcome_only",
